OL,3,AWhat video footage tells us about RAF
OL,4,Atraining jet crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe RAF is investigating a crash
OL,7,Finvolving one of its high-speed Hawk
OL,8,Ffighter jets after two of its pilots
OL,9,Fejected and parachuted out of their
OL,10,Fplane moments before it crashed and
OL,11,Fburst into flames.
OL,13,FThe RAF said that training on these
OL,14,Fjets had been "temporarily" paused as a
OL,15,F"precautionary measure".
OL,17,FNorth Wales Police said the pilots, who
OL,18,Fhad been flying a training aircraft,
OL,19,Fwere being treated for minor injuries.
OL,20,FBoth are doing well and are expected to
OL,21,Fmake a "full recovery", the RAF said on
OL,22,FThursday.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
